Part A
Smartcare needs a small prototype that allows a receptionist to record patient appoinments. each appoinment records paitent name, GP and appoinment time

1. what data must be stored 
paitent name, gp name and full appoitment data/time

2. what functions might be usefull 
A function to book/add an appointment, one to list all appointments, and ideally one to cancel or change an existing appointment.

3. what could go wrong
 Two patients could be booked with the same gp at the same time, required fields could be left blank, or the time could be entered in an invalid format.

4. what requirements are unclear?
Whether the clinic needs appointments to be saved between runs, whether practitioners need their own logins, and how far in advance appointments can be booked.

